OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright spells and a scattering
OL,6,Fof showers, the best of the sunshine
OL,7,Facross Orkney during the morning.
OL,8,FModerate to fresh southwest winds,
OL,9,Foccasionally strong at first across
OL,10,FShetland.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy or bright during this
OL,13,Fevening and overnight with occasional
OL,14,Fclear spells. Mainly dry, although the
OL,15,Fodd shower is possible. Winds turning
OL,16,Finto the west, light to moderate.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
