OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FBright with sunny spells and
OL,6,Fa scattering of showers across
OL,7,FShetland. The showers could becoming
OL,8,Fheavy and perhaps thundery across
OL,9,FOrkney.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBright
OL,12,Fspells and showers on Friday and over
OL,13,Fthe weekend. The showers occasionally
OL,14,Fheavy. Mainly light to moderate west
OL,15,For southwest winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
